<div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">

<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight">
          Nuestros servicios agrícolas
        </h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          Soluciones especializadas para todas las necesidades de tu explotación.
        </p>
</div>
<!-- Grid 6 Servicios -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
<!-- Tarjeta 1 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col group">
<div class="relative h-56 overflow-hidden">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="Close up of agrarian documents, Spanish PAC subsidy forms, SIGPAC maps on wooden table with eyeglasses and olive branches in natural bright daylight." src="/assets/service-pac-hd.jpg"/>
<span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-sm text-primary font-label-caption text-label-caption px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md uppercase font-bold">
              Gestión &amp; Legal
            </span>
</div>
<div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
<div class="space-y-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Gestión Agraria, PAC y Subvenciones
              </h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Tramitación integral de ayudas PAC, derechos y regularizaciones SIGPAC. Convocatorias de modernización y cuadernos de explotación digitales según normativa vigente.
              </p>
</div>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary hover:text-secondary font-semibold pt-2" href="/servicios#gestion-pac">
<span>Ver servicio</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Tarjeta 2 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col group">
<div class="relative h-56 overflow-hidden">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="Young olive and almond saplings lined in modern commercial nursery greenhouses ready for agricultural transplant with precision drip irrigation lines." src="/assets/nursery-hd.jpg"/>
<span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-sm text-primary font-label-caption text-label-caption px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md uppercase font-bold">
              Plantaciones
            </span>
</div>
<div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
<div class="space-y-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Viveros y Plantaciones Agrícolas
              </h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Suministro certificado de plantas de olivar, almendro y pistacho. Diseño agronómico de marco, preparación previa del terreno e instalación de sistemas de fertirriego.
              </p>
</div>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary hover:text-secondary font-semibold pt-2" href="/servicios#viveros-plantaciones">
<span>Ver servicio</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
