<div class="relative h-56 overflow-hidden">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="Specialized agricultural mist sprayer tractor applying organic foliar treatment in Spanish olive grove during early sunrise mist." src="/assets/service-sprayer-hd.jpg"/>
<span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-sm text-primary font-label-caption text-label-caption px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md uppercase font-bold">
              Sanidad Vegetal
            </span>
</div>
<div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
<div class="space-y-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Fertilización y Tratamientos Fitosanitarios
              </h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Planes de abonado basados en análisis foliares y de suelo. Aplicación fitosanitaria certificada contra plagas clave como repilo, mosca del olivo y barrenillo.
              </p>
</div>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary hover:text-secondary font-semibold pt-2" href="/servicios#fertilizacion-sanidad">
<span>Ver servicio</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Tarjeta 5 -->
